/K [2]
>>
endobj
359 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 795 0 R
/E (Threshold Detection: A Schmitt trigger comparator monitors the integrator's ramp output via positive feedback. When the ramp reaches the predefined upper threshold voltage, the comparator output trips abruptly to positive rail saturation.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
360 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 796 0 R
/E (Flyback Discharge & Reset: The saturated comparator output turns on an NPN flyback transistor switch, providing a low-impedance path that rapidly discharges the capacitor across the virtual ground to complete the flyback phase and restart the oscillation cycle.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
